# AlphaLedger secrets. Copy this to the local dotfile the repository never
# tracks, which is already gitignored, and fill in the values there:
#
#     cp env.example .env
#
# Both guards block reading, printing, or committing that dotfile. This file
# lists NAMES ONLY. Never write a value here, and never paste one into a chat,
# a log, a screenshot, or a commit.
#
# Only secrets belong here. Operational constants live in config/ instead,
# because a run has to be provable after the fact and an untracked file cannot
# be hashed into the evidence ledger. See config/README.md and D-017.

# Alpaca paper credentials. Paper only. There is no live counterpart, and the
# application refuses any host but https://paper-api.alpaca.markets
ALPACA_API_KEY=
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=

# Optional, and not needed until the news labeler in UNIT-023 exists.
# LLM_API_KEY=
